From 6f92e89bbf32f738fd818feaa2ee7dc0ba3c283a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Connor Avila <Connoravila@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 16:11:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] libwally-core: vendor the anti-exfil secp256k1 module

The module needs secp256k1 internals, so it is compiled in the same
translation unit as wally's amalgamation through a small wrapper, in both
the amalgamated and component builds. The relative includes of the module
are satisfied by forwarding headers. Nothing calls it yet.
